            <ArticleTitle>Anomalous median nerve position dorsal to the flexor tendons in a patient with spastic hemiplegia and wrist pain: case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>867-70</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report an anomalous dorsally positioned median nerve within the carpal tunnel in a 25-year-old spastic hemiplegic man associated with chronic wrist pain.</AbstractText>
